  m_Name: Retreat_Recover
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Behavior.Authoring::Unity.Behavior.BehaviorAuthoringGraph
  Blackboard: {fileID: 1987486539175907595}
  m_Description: 'Reusable graph-owned retreat: Moving -> native survival Wait -> progressive Recovering. Signal-driven restarts handle damage/danger; one normal dynamic AttackOnce counter is time-bounded. Cornered/damaged recovery exits to Attack. Parallel cleanup scope stops movement and clears state on interruption.'
